    # --- restored over the homonym gate, on the owner's own examples ---
    #
    # The gate dropped these and the gate was outvoted. "If it says THINK - okay,
    # we have a shot for thinking" and "if he's talking about STARLINK" are two
    # of the three examples he gave when he asked for the expansion, so a
    # vocabulary that ships without them has missed the brief.
    #
    # The gate's objection to "think" is real and small: over 2,512 sentences it
    # displaced a better pick 13 times, about half a percent. It is also five
    # letters, and candidates() ranks on LENGTH, so it only ever wins a group
    # with nothing more specific in it - which is exactly the group that would
    # otherwise have gone out as a literal search. "starlink" was dropped for
    # beating "spacex" in a sentence about Musk; a satellite dish is the right
    # picture for the word Starlink, and that is the whole point of naming it.
