# WHO THE PORTRAIT TIER RECOGNISES, and what to show when it cannot find one.
#
# name -> (the query Commons is asked, the PICTURE to fall back on)
#
# THE FALLBACK IS NOT DECORATION. Commons has no correctly-licensed portrait of
# everybody - measured, Jensen Huang's frames are all CC BY-SA, which
# search_people refuses - and a term that finds nothing gets searched literally,
# which for a person's name is the exact failure this tier exists to end. So
# every name carries the picture that WAS its answer until 2026-08-25: a head of
# state falls back to their capital, a central banker to their bank, a chief
# executive to what their company makes.
#
# Add a name the first time a show says it. A surname on its own is listed too,
# because "Powell said" and "Carney called" are how people actually talk, and it
# points at the same query as the full name.
